1564	**
1565	**  7 bits - A
1566	** 14 bits - BA
1567	** 21 bits - BBA
1568	** 28 bits - BBBA
1569	** 35 bits - BBBBA
1570	** 42 bits - BBBBBA
1571	** 49 bits - BBBBBBA
