2053	** filename in zBaseFilename is a URI with the "8_3_names=1" parameter and
2054	** if filename in z[] has a suffix (a.k.a. "extension") that is longer than
2055	** three characters, then shorten the suffix on z[] to be the last three
2056	** characters of the original suffix.
